sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User
  participant UI as Multimodal Input UI
  participant Upload as Upload/Stream API
  participant Store as Attachments Store (TTL)
  participant Agent as Agent

  User->>UI: Select/Drop files/audio/image
  UI->>Upload: Validate & send
  Upload->>Store: Persist attachment (type,size,url,ttl)
  Store-->>Upload: Ack
  Agent->>Store: Fetch/consume attachment
